{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:701","content":{"id":701,"title":"删除有序数组中的重复项","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项"}],"level":2},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个有序数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你"},{"type":"formatted","text":"原地","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"删除重复出现的元素，使每个元素 只出现一次 ，返回删除后数组的新长度。不要使用额外的数组空间，你必须在"},{"type":"formatted","text":"原地","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"修改输入数组并在使用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"O(1)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 额外空间的条件下完成。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"输入：nums = [1,1,2]\n输出：2, nums = [1,2]","language":"java","uuid":"b04636b2-9374-46d8-ab68-2529af26ae96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"输入：nums = [0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]\n输出：5, nums = [0,1,2,3,4]","language":"java","uuid":"32686fd4-50bb-4fc1-bf50-32f41611117b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们遍历数组时，我们使用数组已遍历的部分保存不重复的元素，定义两个指针，指针 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向无重复部分的末尾，指针 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cur","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向当前正在遍历的元素，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[size - 1] != nums[cur]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[cur]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个元素是第一次出现的，应当将它添加到无重复数组的末尾，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"size++","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"public int removeDuplicates(int[] nums) {\n    if (nums.length == 0) {\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    int size = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (nums[size - 1] != nums[i]) {\n            nums[size] = nums[i];\n            size++;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return size;\n}","language":"java","uuid":"f1d8e6fb-4256-4fa9-b1c8-14f335f75803","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项II"}],"level":2},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个有序数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你原地删除重复出现的元素，使每个元素最多出现"},{"type":"formatted","text":"两次","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，返回删除后数组的新长度。不要使用额外的数组空间，你必须在原地修改输入数组 并在使用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"O(1)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 额外空间的条件下完成。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同上面一样，定义两个指针 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cur","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这道题要求每个元素最多出现两次，那我们比较 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[size - 2]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[cur]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果二者不同，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[cur]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 没有出现两次，这时可以将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[cur]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加至 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处，并进行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"size++","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"public static int removeDuplicates(int[] nums) {\n    int len = nums.length;\n    if(len<=2){\n        return len;\n    }\n\n    int size = 2;\n    int cur = 2;\n    while(cur < len){\n        if(nums[size - 2] != nums[cur]){\n            nums[size++] = nums[cur];\n        }\n        cur++;\n    }\n    return size;\n}","language":"java","uuid":"61389fe0-2493-4faf-9ef1-24f93e5fec79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}],"level":2},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/remove-duplicates-from-sorted-array/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/remove-duplicates-from-sorted-array-ii/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项 II"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"删除有序数组中的重复项","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:701","type":"doc","id":701}}],"prevPage":{"title":"合并区间","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:691","type":"doc","id":691}},"nextPage":{"title":"盛水最多的容器","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:702","type":"doc","id":702}},"createTime":1729001395139,"updateTime":1744296486800,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296486800}}